      en: ["The army was discovered on March 29, 1974, by local farmers.", "It consists of roughly 8,000 soldiers, 130 chariots, and 670 horses.", "The warriors' heights vary according to their rank, up to 195 cm (6.4 ft).", "More than 700,000 laborers worked on the necropolis for nearly 40 years.", "The bronze weapons were treated with chromium to prevent corrosion.", "The site was inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List in 1987."],
